{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29354","headline":"饮席戏赠同舍 · 李商隐","name":"饮席戏赠同舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞中屐响省分携，不是花迷客自迷。\n珠树重行怜翡翠，玉楼双舞羡鵾鸡。\n兰回旧蘂缘屏绿，椒缀新香和壁泥。\n唱尽阳关无限叠，半杯松叶冻颇黎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}